   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the voice is ever heard",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How can they believe without a sound",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Without a preacher standing near",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How can they hear if no one speaks",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Unless the messenger is sent",
